<h2>Before your first shot</h2>

<h3>Calibrate Temperature Offset</h3>

<p>Temperature offset calibration has a significant impact on extraction.</p>

<p>Before changing profile settings, make sure your temperature offset is calibrated correctly.</p>

<p>See the temperature calibration guide for detailed instructions.</p>

<h3>Flush Before Brewing</h3>

<p>Recommended for maximum consistency.</p>

<p>Helps stabilize:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Boiler water level</li>
  <li>Residual pressure</li>
  <li>Group head temperature</li>
  <li>Starting conditions</li>
</ul>

<p>This helps the brew temperature start closer to the target temperature and improves shot-to-shot consistency.</p>
